#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra freedom description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Discover your journey, navigate the world with privacy and community at the forefront."
msgstr "Otkrij svoj put, navigiraj svijetom uz privatnost i zajednicu na prvom mjestu."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra freedom title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Freedom Is Here"
msgstr "Sloboda je tu"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra map description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Community + Open Maps"
msgstr "Zajednica + Otvorene karte"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra preinstalls description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "CoMaps comes preinstalled on these operating systems as their default map app."
msgstr "CoMaps dolazi unaprijed instaliran na ovim operativnim sustavima kao njihova zadana aplikacija za karte."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra preinstalls title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trusted by these projects"
msgstr "Ovi projekti imaju povjerenje"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plan and navigate your trip abroad with just GPS, no need for mobile data. Search waypoints while on remote hiking trails or bike paths. Navigate with turn-by-turn instructions by foot, bike or car, including voice announcements."
msgstr "Planiraj i upravljaj svojim putovanjem u inozemstvo samo pomoću GPS-a, bez potrebe za mobilnim podacima. Pretražuj točke interesa na udaljenim planinarskim ili biciklističkim stazama."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items highlight text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "No internet needed"
msgstr "Nije potreban internet"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Offline Search and Routing"
msgstr "Izvanmrežno pretraživanje i navigacija"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the outdoor mode to highlight hiking trails, campsites, and water sources. Enable contour lines to plan your trip. Spot an interesting peak along the way? Use the offline *Wikipedia* articles to learn more about it!"
msgstr "Koristi način rada na otvorenom kako bi istaknuo pješačke staze, kampove i izvore vode. Omogući konturne linije za planiranje putovanja. Uoči zanimljiv vrh na putu? Koristi izvanmrežne članke *Wikipedije* da bi saznao više o tome!"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items highlight text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore nature"
msgstr "Istraži prirodu"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hike with the Information you Need"
msgstr "Pješači s informacijama koje trebaš"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Efficiently uses the battery, doesn’t drain your battery like other navigation apps."
msgstr "Učinkovito koristi bateriju, ne troši je kao druge navigacijske aplikacije."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items highlight text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Efficient battery use"
msgstr "Učinkovito korištenje baterije"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save Your Battery"
msgstr "Štedite bateriju"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the public transport layer to plan your subway and light rail journeys in a growing list of cities."
msgstr "Koristi sloj javnog prijevoza za planiranje putovanja podzemnom željeznicom i lakom željeznicom u sve većem popisu gradova."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items highlight text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Explore the city"
msgstr "Istraži grad"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get around the City"
msgstr "Kreći se gradom"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The app is designed with privacy in mind - does not identify people, does not track you, and does not collect any information. CoMaps was also audited by <span class=\"text-icon\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 19 19\"><use href=\"#icon-exodus\"></use></svg> [Exodus](https://reports.exodus-privacy.eu.org/reports/app.comaps.google/latest/), a privacy auditor."
msgstr "Aplikacija je dizajnirana imajući na umu privatnost - ne identificira ljude, ne prati vas i ne prikuplja nikakve podatke. CoMaps je također revidirao <span class=\"text-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\"><use href=\"#icon-exodus\"></use></svg> [Exodus](https://reports.exodus-privacy.eu.org/reports/app.comaps.google/latest/)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items highlight text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Privacy by default"
msgstr "Privatnost na prvom mjestu"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "No Data Collection"
msgstr "Bez prikupljanja podataka"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items description
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "CoMaps is recommended by *[Switching Software](https://switching.software/replace/google-maps/)*, *[European & Open Source Alternatives](https://european-alternatives.cloud/en/browse?category=maps)*, *[Digital Independence Day](https://di.day/en/digital-switch-recipes/maps)* ,and *[Framastart](https://framastart.org/smartphone/)* as an ethical, easy-to-use and privacy-conscious alternative to commercial maps."
msgstr "CoMaps preporučuje *[Switching Software](https://switching.software/replace/google-maps/)*, *[European & Open Source Alternatives](https://european-alternatives.cloud/en/browse?category=maps)*, *[Digital Independence Day](https://di.day/en/digital-switch-recipes/maps)* , i *[Framastart](https://framastart.org/smartphone/)* kao etičku, jednostavnu za korištenje i svjesnu privatnosti alternativu komercijalnim kartama."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items highlight text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Independent maps"
msgstr "Nezavisne karte"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items title
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "A True Alternative"
msgstr "Prava alternativa"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: extra services items cta text
#: content/_index.md
#, no-wrap
